  "all_original_cases": 1408,
  "hypothesis": "Every one of all704 original H3bf unresolved checkpoints admits an adaptive decision tree of depth at most4 that exactly identifies EVERY remaining candidate, not only the realized true model.",
  "primary": "All704 checkpoint sets feasible at frozen depth4. Any fully certified infeasible set falsifies universal primary. Resource cap/error yields entire-study incomplete, never infeasible or reduced scope.704knownsuccesses retained separately as no-new-tree context.",
  "inputs": "Complete hash-pinned candidate predictions on73712ordinaryN13boards; current remaining candidate set only, allsize2..16. Compiler receives sorted candidateIDs, complete signature catalog, depth and shared counters; no trueID, bankID, realized label or oracle input. No posterior weighting.",
  "catalog": "For each distinct current candidate set, encode each board prediction as local candidate bitmask. Retain EVERY distinct signature including0/full, multiplicity and lexfirst board index. Every induced nontrivial bipartition on each recursive subset is considered; complement-equivalent splits deduplicated with lexfirst board representative.",
  "exact_search": "Memoize(subsetmask,remainingdepth) per root. Singleton is feasible; |S|>2^depth is certified infeasible. Try all canonical partitions in lex board order, pruning child cardinality>2^(depth-1). Retain every attempted split and decisive child proof. Return first feasible split with both children feasible; infeasible only after all nontrivial partitions exhausted. Feasible tree is a depth<=4 witness, not a claim of minimal depth.",
  "no_repeats": "Every selected query is nontrivial on its current candidate subset; each previously queried board is unanimous there, hence cannot be selected again. Verify every original queried board is unanimous at the checkpoint and every certified branch has no repeats.",
  "certificates": "Retain full catalogs and every visited memo-state proof/attempt, full feasible trees and all candidate leaf depths. Independently replay each state and all candidate branches. Infeasibility certificate covers every catalog-induced canonical partition with child-information bound or certified infeasible child. No heuristic success substitution.",
  "deduplication": "Compile byte-equal sorted candidate sets once, with all704 mappings preserved; all1408 original case records map to a compiled root or known-success context. No case/competitor pruning.",
  "synthetic_gate": "Before actual checkpoint compilation: two-model lex ties; singleton-only4models depth2false/depth3true; duplicate predictions infeasible;16binary models depth4true/depth3false;3models depth1false/depth2true. Compare independent brute force; state/split caps must raise ResourceCap incomplete, not logicalfalse. Toy work charged to shared counters.",
  "interpretation": "Exact truth-blind policy feasibility on examined postselected checkpoints. Zero new source samples or oracle-label acquisition. Trees identify all remaining models if executed under noiseless membership; no fresh confirmation, generalization beyond suppliedclass, posterior-accuracy or optimal-policy claim.",
  "budget": {
