    "definition": "Count every new memo state and every inspected canonical split, including information-bound prunes and synthetic gate work, globally across roots. Catalog construction also charged to CPU/wall.",
    "enforcement": "Whole-study incomplete on either count cap/CPU/wall/error; retain completed/partial evidence and all case scope, never relabel cap as infeasible."
